(This README file is public domain.)

The plain TeX style files for TUGboat, the journal of the TeX Users Group.
See https://tug.org/TUGboat for all issues, contact information,
  notes for authors, and all else.

tugboat.sty is for both regular and proceedings issue.  Just \input it.
tugproc.sty was for proceedings issue, but is no longer used.

microtype-plain-tub.tex is a minimal implementation for microtype (font
expansion and protrusion) on the plain TeX \tenrm font, etc. It should
not be installed by default, since it's so limited. See comments in the file.
